[@1]
<h2>~wLord of Sun</h2>
<p>Looks like our intelligence is in working order, once we recieve the Knowledge of thunder we will hunt for further knowledge!

[@2]
<h2>~mMinion of Thunder</h2>
<p>Pah Sun weaklings, prepare to suffer painful deaths!

[@3]
<h2>~rMinion of Sun</h2>
<p>Sure.......

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Beginning</h2> 
<i>"Never let your allies do all the fighting, when you are caught on your own, you will never survive!"<br> 
--Unknown</i>

<p>Your Lord, "Lord of sun" has decided that it is time to bring some more powerful knowledge into the clan.

A minion of thunder has been detected 20km from base, 
The lord has brought you and 2 other minions to make sure your clan recieves the technology.

This is the beginning of the quest for ultimate power, Greater odds offer greater rewards, make your Lord proud!

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Congratulations! </h2> 
<p>Your clan has emerged victorious, 
Your Lord is Pleased as your clan has recieved the knowledge of THUNDER!!!!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Retaliation



[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have let your clan become the laughing stock of the entire world of nimbus, Your Lord sends your soul to hell!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain


[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~rMinion of sun</h2>
<p>I wouldnt mind BUT IM UNDER ATTACK!!!!

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wLord of Sun</h2>
<p>I cannot withstand this assault much longer....

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>~mMinion of Thunder</h2>
<p>I said you would all perish!

[ai3PreistDead]
<h2>Your Lord has been Slain!</h2>
<p>you are forced to retreat without your Lord, the clan is now in disarray, many enemies take advantage and kill you all!
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gMinion of Sun</h2>
<p>I am Under Attack!

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~mMinion of Thunder</h2>
<p>I warn You, Leave now while you are still alive!

[ai5TempleDead]
<h2>~mMinion of Thunder</h2>
<p>WHAT??? BLAST!! My Master shall squash you like insects for this!

[ai5PriestDead]
<h2>~wLord of Sun</h2>
<p>Well done, that wasnt easy im forced to admit but we got what we came for.
Hopefully our future battles may be a little easier!


[END] 







